WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.041 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
Agent onboarding of a past permit,
before and after the engine fix.

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:07.463 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
Open Routing and Permits
on the first load.

00:00:07.965 --> 00:00:11.024 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
The automation principal
confirmed this Pennsylvania

00:00:11.104 --> 00:00:14.280 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
permit on November eighth
as a forty three mile route.

00:00:14.777 --> 00:00:17.718 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
The whole trip is three
hundred thirty five miles.

00:00:18.283 --> 00:00:19.636 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
Open the review screen.

00:00:20.276 --> 00:00:22.394 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
The route starts at exit nineteen A,

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.897 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
where Interstate eighty meets
Interstate seventy nine.

00:00:26.046 --> 00:00:29.222 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
The origin at the New Jersey
line was never delivered.

00:00:29.832 --> 00:00:32.361 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
The line runs down
Interstate seventy nine,

00:00:32.595 --> 00:00:36.460 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
then west on US four twenty
two past New Castle to Ohio.

00:00:37.381 --> 00:00:40.028 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
Now open the same permit
on the fixed engine.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:44.833 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
The same permit was digitized again
on the fixed engine on November tenth.

00:00:45.187 --> 00:00:48.893 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
It confirms at three hundred
thirty three point six five miles,

00:00:49.032 --> 00:00:50.385 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
across the whole state.

00:00:51.036 --> 00:00:52.389 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
Open its review screen.

00:00:53.012 --> 00:00:55.247 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
The route now starts at the New Jersey

00:00:55.327 --> 00:00:57.857 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
state line and ends at
the Ohio state line.

00:00:58.448 --> 00:01:00.801 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
Every step is confirmed with the permit.

00:01:01.356 --> 00:01:02.556 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
On the server side,

00:01:02.636 --> 00:01:06.930 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
the confirm step now holds a route
whose length is not the printed total.

00:01:07.084 --> 00:01:11.378 line:72% position:50% align:center size:90%
An automation approval cannot serve
until two blind reads have signed it.
